{"kind": "pr", "number": 760, "title": "subscription: fix producer goroutine leak on context cancel", "status": "adapted", "rationale": "Fixes #758. Wraps the event-loop send in a select on p.Context.Done(). The single-value send and every error-path send have the same bare send and leak the same way; all reproduced before the fix. This fork routes every send through one context-aware send, with regression tests for event, single-value and resolver-error paths.", "date": "2026-09-13", "local": "577e9e4"}
{"kind": "pr", "number": 757, "title": "fix(util): support int16 and uint types in getGraphType and getGraphList", "status": "adapted", "rationale": "BindFields int16/uint kinds. Taken: int16, uint8, uint16 bind as Int, scalar and list (previously String, and slices panicked). Not taken: uint, uint32, uint64; they exceed Int's 32 bits and coerceInt returns null out of range, turning a large value that serializes today as String into null. Test-name typo fix taken.", "date": "2026-09-13", "local": "9844c66"}
