{"kind": "issue", "number": 543, "title": "`Object.AddFieldConfig` doesn't work with `FieldsThunk`", "status": "fixed", "rationale": "AddFieldConfig on Object, Interface and InputObject now works with thunk-defined fields, before and after first resolve.", "date": "2026-11-20", "local": "e10c335"}
